    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014930/extras/466a22b4af853aeb9523711832c11eff.avif?t=1749466890\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT</h2>A Last Will and Testament is first person adventure horror game in escape room style with lots of puzzles to solve. Fulfill the last will and find a testament.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014930/extras/2db0ce569398d67a3839a9565e3fff70.poster.avif?t=1749466890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014930/extras/2db0ce569398d67a3839a9565e3fff70.webm?t=1749466890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014930/extras/2db0ce569398d67a3839a9565e3fff70.mp4?t=1749466890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 100 Steam Achievements hidden in the haunted house! Find it!<br></li><li> Story &amp; voice-over<br></li><li> Two endings (normal and really, really secret ending)<br></li><li> Beatiful and creepy graphic<br></li><li> Creepy haunted house ambience and music<br></li><li> Puzzles<br></li><li> Length of the game: 2-4 hours (5+ hours if you want to see the secret ending, find all collectibles etc.)<br></li><li> Good optimization<br></li><li> Hot price <br></li><li> Save/load game any time<br></li><li> Autosave<br></li><li> Keyboard and mouse or gamepad controls<br></li><li> 29 langauges<br></li><li> Options (graphics, disable niose/VHS effect, audio, configure controls, invert y-axis, subtitles, mouse/gamepad sensitivity etc.)<br></li><li> Notes<br></li><li> Linux, Windows and Mac OS support<br></li><li> All resolution supports (21:9, Ultrawide etc.)<br></li><li> Steam clouds<br></li><li> Steam remote (TV, phone etc.)</li></ul><br><i><strong>Not for the faint-hearted</strong></i>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014930/extras/466a22b4af853aeb9523711832c11eff.avif?t=1749466890\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT</h2>A Last Will and Testament is first person adventure horror game in escape room style with lots of puzzles to solve. Fulfill the last will and find a testament.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014930/extras/2db0ce569398d67a3839a9565e3fff70.poster.avif?t=1749466890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014930/extras/2db0ce569398d67a3839a9565e3fff70.webm?t=1749466890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014930/extras/2db0ce569398d67a3839a9565e3fff70.mp4?t=1749466890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 100 Steam Achievements hidden in the haunted house! Find it!<br></li><li> Story &amp; voice-over<br></li><li> Two endings (normal and really, really secret ending)<br></li><li> Beatiful and creepy graphic<br></li><li> Creepy haunted house ambience and music<br></li><li> Puzzles<br></li><li> Length of the game: 2-4 hours (5+ hours if you want to see the secret ending, find all collectibles etc.)<br></li><li> Good optimization<br></li><li> Hot price <br></li><li> Save/load game any time<br></li><li> Autosave<br></li><li> Keyboard and mouse or gamepad controls<br></li><li> 29 langauges<br></li><li> Options (graphics, disable niose/VHS effect, audio, configure controls, invert y-axis, subtitles, mouse/gamepad sensitivity etc.)<br></li><li> Notes<br></li><li> Linux, Windows and Mac OS support<br></li><li> All resolution supports (21:9, Ultrawide etc.)<br></li><li> Steam clouds<br></li><li> Steam remote (TV, phone etc.)</li></ul><br><i><strong>Not for the faint-hearted</strong></i>",
